## 13. Validation Rule

After any documentation governance batch, run:

```text
git diff --check
git status --short
```

If files were staged, also run:

```text
git diff --cached --name-status
```

Report:

- files created
- files modified
- files renamed
- files moved
- files deleted
- validation result
- safety notes
